  {
   "texto": "I'm Dana, twenty-three, and I work the night shift there.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The owner taped three rules to the register.",
   "pausa": 0.4
  },
  {
   "texto": "Lock the door at two. Never go outside. Don't look at the trees.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 2:14, a car pulled in with its headlights off.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Nobody got out. The engine just kept running.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then my phone buzzed. No signal, but a text came in.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
